mod backend.types.program;

/**
 * THE PROGRAM AS A WHOLE
 *
 * The files of this package (module `backend.types.program`):
 *
 *      sharp_module.sharp  sharp_module, sharp_file (with its imports), sharp_program
 *      well_known.sharp    the library classes the language itself needs (string, int, _object_ ...), found once
 *      node_helpers.sharp  small helpers: a diagnostic at a tree node, a dotted name
 *      obfuscation_rule.sharp  one name of an `obfuscate` block, tied to the module or declaration it names
 *      analysed_program.sharp  the analysed program: the one object handed to code generation (main,
 *                              every function and class, what is reached from main)
 *
 * This file is the package's front door: it only says what is where.
 */
